INSERT INTO `chat_message` (`id`, `session_id`, `role`, `content`, `rewritten_query`, `strategy_snapshot`, `agent_run_id`, `prompt_tokens`, `completion_tokens`, `finish_reason`, `error_message`, `cost_millis`, `create_time`) VALUES (510,243,'assistant','According to the documentation, the differences between the three models, GTE-3000, GTE-3000S, and GTE-3000Pro, are as follows:\n\n| Item | GTE-3000 | GTE-3000S | GTE-3000Pro |\n|------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n| **Processor** | Quad-core 1.2GHz | Quad-core 1.2GHz | Octa-core 1.8GHz |\n| **Memory** | 2GB | 4GB | 8GB |\n| **Storage** | 8GB eMMC | 16GB eMMC | 64GB eMMC |\n| **Ethernet Port** | 2 × Gigabit | 4 × Gigabit | 4 × Gigabit |\n| **Serial Port** | 2 × RS485 | 4 × RS485/RS232 | 4 × RS485/RS232 |\n| **Wireless** | None | 4G Full Network | 5G + Wi-Fi 6 |\n| **Point Limit** | 2000 points | 5000 points | 20000 points |\n| **Digital I/O** | Not supported (not mentioned in the documentation) | Not supported (not mentioned in the documentation) | 4 channels DI (dry contact input), 2 channels DO (relay output, contact capacity 30VDC/2A) |\n\nNote:  \n- GTE-3000S and GTE-3000Pro support LAN3/LAN4 configured as switch ports (for cascading), while GTE-3000 is not mentioned to have this capability;  \n- GTE-3000Pro uniquely supports the CNC device FOCAS protocol ([Document 5]);  \n- GTE-3000Pro has local inference capability and can run lightweight vision detection models ([Document 1]);  \n- Typical power consumption (not a user requirement item, but explicitly mentioned in the documentation): GTE-3000 6.5W, GTE-3000S 9.2W, GTE-3000Pro 15.8W.','List the differences between the GTE-3000, GTE-3000S, and GTE-3000Pro, including processor, memory, interfaces, wireless connectivity, and data point limits.','{\"id\": 2, \"name\": \"Advanced - Hybrid search\", \"vector_enabled\": \"Yes\", \"vector_top_k\": 8, \"bm25_enabled\": \"Yes\", \"bm25_top_k\": 8, \"rrf_k\": 60, \"rerank_enabled\": \"No\", \"rerank_model_id\": null, \"rerank_top_n\": 3, \"query_rewrite_enabled\": \"No\", \"rewrite_type\": null, \"multi_query_count\": 3, \"parent_recall_enabled\": \"No\", \"score_threshold\": 0.3, \"metadata_filter\": null, \"is_default\": \"No\", \"remark\": \"Vector plus BM25 dual-path retrieval followed by RRF fusion, to solve the problem of retrieving proper nouns.\", \"create_time\": \"2026-09-03 21:09:50+08:00\", \"update_time\": \"2026-09-03 21:09:50+08:00\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Answered',NULL,8614,'2026-09-05 16:38:27');
